  "goodToKnow": "Der Ballbesitz is possession in ball sports, especially football: mehr Ballbesitz haben, 60 Prozent Ballbesitz. Possession-based football (Ballbesitzfußball) became famous through Barcelona's tiki-taka and Pep Guardiola's Bayern Munich. Der Besitz means possession or property, and besitzen to own. Its counterpart is das Umschaltspiel (transition play). It has no plural."
